200
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:47,933
- I... I don't...
- I need an answer immediately.

201
00:14:48,137 --> 00:14:50,890
Here is my direct number
at the Grand Hotel.

202
00:14:51,057 --> 00:14:54,186
- You live at a hotel?
- Well, I own the hotel and I live there.

203
00:14:54,352 --> 00:14:56,025
My life is very much like Monopoly.

204
00:14:56,187 --> 00:15:01,535
And I know you wouldn't care,
but I'll start you at $250,000.

205
00:15:04,153 --> 00:15:06,747
There's also usually
a very nice Christmas bonus.

206
00:15:08,366 --> 00:15:10,118
Thank you.

207
00:15:25,341 --> 00:15:27,594
