- Hey, Rocco.

208
00:16:11,012 --> 00:16:13,731
- I can't believe how much I ate.
- I'm proud of you.

209
00:16:13,890 --> 00:16:15,938
The whole left side of the menu.

210
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:18,194
You know when I get tense,
I just start to eat.

211
00:16:18,352 --> 00:16:23,950
- Honey, you cannot work for that man.
- Hey, we can use the bail money.

212
00:16:24,108 --> 00:16:26,031
- Remember what Sun Tzu said?
- Yes.

213
00:16:26,194 --> 00:16:29,869
